# Clojure CLI classpath cache — machine-specific absolute paths, never shared
.cpcache/

# Test artifacts. `clj/target/test-burn-*` is written by
# dougaka.pipeline-test on every run — mp4/wav/png that describe one machine
# on one day. Two such directories were committed by accident on 2026-09-01
# (a `git add -A` after running the suite) and one predates that; this stops
# the next run adding a third.
clj/target/
